  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 15.38,
      "end": 17.18,
      "text": "Hello Canada Post, how may I help you?",
      "confidence": 0.886,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 17.5,
      "end": 28.82,
      "text": "Hi there. I had a package that was scheduled to arrive, but it has not arrived yet. And I'm just kind of wondering where it's at because I don't have any updates on the package and I need it.",
      "confidence": 0.972,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 30.38,
      "end": 30.9,
      "text": "And",
      "confidence": 0.43,
      "low_confidence": true,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 30.9,
      "end": 34.08,
      "text": "so how do I find it?",
      "confidence": 0.865,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 35.42,
      "end": 39.84,
      "text": "Okay. One moment, please. I'm going to open our tracking.",
      "confidence": 0.976,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 42.18,
      "end": 53.74,
      "text": "Okay. Do you have the tracking number on hand? I do. Okay. Please read it out to me, and I'll repeat it back to you. Okay. It is X18T.",
      "confidence": 0.991,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 55.86,
      "end": 58.4,
      "text": "X18T. B516.",
      "confidence": 0.995,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 60.52,
      "end": 62.74,
      "text": "B516. B516. MZHN.",
      "confidence": 0.649,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 65.0,
      "end": 65.44,
      "text": "MZHN?",
      "confidence": 0.892,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 66.16,
      "end": 67.72,
      "text": "N at the end, like Normand.",
      "confidence": 0.801,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 68.66,
      "end": 72.66,
      "text": "Okay, got it. Okay, sure. One sec, let me just pull it up.",
      "confidence": 0.953,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 75.78,
      "end": 87.2,
      "text": "Yeah, I unfortunately really need these like yesterday. So, if we can find it and maybe reroute it, I don't know. But it has my divorce papers in it, and I really need these documents.",
      "confidence": 0.957,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 87.94,
      "end": 99.26,
      "text": "I understand. Okay. I see that it's in the sorting center in Mississauga and that it's meant to be going to Ottawa.",
      "confidence": 0.918,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 105.18,
      "end": 111.24,
      "text": "Okay. It's scheduled to be loaded onto the truck today.",
      "confidence": 0.939,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 114.54,
      "end": 121.06,
      "text": "Is there a reason that it's been delayed? Like it was supposed to, it's Monday now and it was supposed to arrive at its destination on Friday.",
      "confidence": 0.906,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 121.42,
      "end": 123.04,
      "text": "And so it's",
      "confidence": 0.947,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 123.04,
      "end": 125.92,
      "text": "probably not even going to get there today if it's still in the sorting center.",
      "confidence": 0.944,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 126.68,
      "end": 146.19,
      "text": "Yeah, I would assume it would arrive tomorrow probably afternoon. As you know, there's been some rolling strikes with our staff. and unfortunately that has caused some delays. I do apologize for that. Unfortunately it's",
      "confidence": 0.942,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 149.9,
      "end": 152.12,
      "text": "impacting everyone negatively and",
      "confidence": 0.82,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
      "role": "Customer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "start": 152.12,
      "end": 156.56,
      "text": "I apologize that we're not meeting your needs.",
      "confidence": 0.989,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "speaker_label": "Speaker 1",
      "role": "Agent"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "start": 157.96,
      "end": 164.2,
      "text": "Are there any options to make it arrive today from Mississauga? Does it have to go in the trucks? Can we fly it?",
      "confidence": 0.904,
